    "answer": {
      "short": "$y=x+1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y(2)&=f(2)g(2)=3\\times1=3\\\\y'(2)&=f'(2)g(2)+f(2)g'(2)\\\\y'(2)&=4\\times1+3\\times(-1)=1\\\\y-3&=1(x-2)\\\\y&=x+1.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
